pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Einstieg DN 1000 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mit Abdeckplatte DN 1000 mm und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Mannloch DN 625 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Auftrittsfläche an Einstiegsseite</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mind. 300 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Neigung der Auftrittsflächen max. 1:20</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Hersteller :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">[PERSON_158], [ORT_013]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">oder gleichwertiger Hersteller</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">01) </span><span style="font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;font-family:Arial;">Schacht 1</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">, nach beiliegendem Lageplan</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mit Übergang DN 800 auf DN 900 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Gefällewechsel und Krümmer 135°</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tiefe von Rohrsohle bis OK Gelände = 1,50 m</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tangentialschacht 1, Tiefe bis 1,50 m</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2227" RNoPart="0009"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">wie vor, jedoch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">02) </span><span style="font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;font-family:Arial;">Schacht 2</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">, nach beiliegendem Lageplan</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mit geradem Gerinne,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tiefe von Rohrsohle bis OK Gelände = 1,65 m</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tangentialschacht 2, Tiefe bis 1,65 m</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2229" RNoPart="0010"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Schachtabdeckung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">DIN EN 124 / DIN 1229,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Deckel rund aus Gußeisen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mit werkseitiger Betonfüllung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Rahmen rund aus Gußeisen mit Beton,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">liefern und fachgerecht versetzen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">und vermörtel, Mörtel liefern.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Deckel mit [PERSON_163]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> DIN 1221-F.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">01) Schachtabdeckung Klasse B 125</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Schachtabdeckung Klasse B 125 liefern und versetzen</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2230" RNoPart="0011"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">wie vor, jedoch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">02) Schachtabdeckung Klasse D 400</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Schachtabdeckung Klasse D 400 liefern und versetzen</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2231" RNoPart="0012"><LumpSumItem>Yes</LumpSumItem><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>psch</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Prüfbare statische Berechnung für</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Einlaufbauwerk durchführen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Festlegung der Betongüten, Wandstärken</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">und Bewehrung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Erstellen der Ausführungszeichnungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Übergabe digital und in [PERSON_097] (3-fach).</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Statische Berechnung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2232" RNoPart="0013"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Einlaufbauwerk aus Stahlbeton,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">nach beiliegender Zeichnung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">einschl. statisch erforderlicher Bewehrung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">liefern und fachgerecht versetzen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Wandstärke mind. 20 cm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Bauwerk bestehend aus :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Bodenplatte 3,00 x 1,20 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Rückwand 1,00 x 2,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Seitenwände 2 x 0,80 x 2,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Seitenwände schräg  2 x 2,00 / 0,00 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">einschl. Muffe für Stahlbetonrohr DN 800 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Hersteller :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">[FIRMA_084] &amp; Co. KG</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Betonwarenfabriken</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Stolzenseeweg 9</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">88353 Kisslegg</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Tel. [TELEFON_077]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">oder gleichwertiger Hersteller</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Anmerkung :</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Verzinktes Stahlgitter ist nicht Bestandteil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">der Ausschreibung und wird bauseits montiert</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Einlaufbauwerk, Fertigteil</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id2044" RNoPart="04"><LblTx><p><span>Stundenlohnarbeiten (Regie)</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id2045"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorbemerkung Arbeitskräfte:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Der Verrechnungssatz enthält sämtliche</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Aufwendungen, den tatsächlichen Lohn</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">und etwaige vermögenswirksamen Leis-</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">tungen mit den Zulagen für Gemeinkosten,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Sozialkassenbeiträge und dergleichen,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">sowie Lohn- und Gehaltsnebenkosten.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Zulagen für Nacht-, Sonn- und Feiertags-</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">arbeit sind jedoch nicht eingerechnet.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorbemerkung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id2046" RNoPart="0001"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorarbeiter (Polier)</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorarbeiter (Polier)</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2047" RNoPart="0002"><Qty>20.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Gehobener Facharbeiter</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Gehobener [PERSON_020]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2048" RNoPart="0003"><Qty>20.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Facharbeiter</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Facharbeiter</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id2049"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorbemerkung Geräte und Fahrzeuge:</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Der Verrechnungssatz enthält sämtliche</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Aufwendungen für den Einsatz,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorhalte- und Betriebsstoffkosten,</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">sowie sämtliche Zulagen, einschließlich</span><br/><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">der Kosten für das Bedienungspersonal.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Vorbemerkung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id2050" RNoPart="0004"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Transporter</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Transporter</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2051" RNoPart="0005"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>Std.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Mini-Bagger bis 0,4 m3</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Minibagger</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2052" RNoPart="0006"><Qty>1